                        <p><strong>Admission Procedure and Requirement:</strong></p> 
                        <p><strong>1.&nbsp;Registration Process</strong></p> 
                        <p style="margin-left:14.2pt;">For online registration click the following link,&nbsp;<a href="http://upj.ac.id/pmb">Online Registration</a><a href="https://admisi.upj.ac.id/">.</a>&nbsp;</p>
                        <p><strong>2.&nbsp;</strong><strong>Registration fee is Rp 200.000,- (two hundred thousands rupiahs)</strong><br>
                            Payment via Shopee, Tokopedia, and BNI with the VA number listed on the MyUPJ application during registration.</p> 
                            <p><strong>3.&nbsp;</strong><strong>Confirmation</strong></p> 
                            <p>&nbsp; &nbsp; Send the payment slip together with the prospective student’s name through email to&nbsp;<a href="mailto:info@upj.ac.id">info@upj.ac.id</a></p> 
                            <p><strong>4.&nbsp;</strong><strong>Selection Process</strong></p> 
                            <p style="margin-left:18.0pt;">The New Students Admission Committee will contact the prospective students by phone or email to explain the selection process for those who apply using theirs report cards or UPJ Entry Test. (*without any transfer proof, the application cannot be processed)</p> 
                            <p><strong>5.&nbsp;</strong><strong>Campus Location</strong>&nbsp; &nbsp;</p>
                            <p style="margin-left:21.3pt;">UPJ campus is very easy to access. To go to UPJ campus, go through JORR, then continue to &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Bintaro Toll, and get&nbsp;out &nbsp;at the Pondok Raji/ Bintaro Gate (take the left gate), and turn left to the way to Bintaro Jaya Xchange, go on the flyover to Sawah Baru, pass the bridge. UPJ campus is located on the left side of the road.&nbsp; Click to see/download&nbsp;<a href="http://upj.ac.id/userfiles/files/img-map-upj-denah.jpg">Location</a>&nbsp;Map</p> 
